
# M151 visual sweep — the JSON report is committed evidence; the 392 full-page
# PNGs it points at are not (they are regenerated by `make ui-visual` and would
# add ~100MB of churn to a public repo on every run).
visual/shots/
visual/.artifacts/
visual/report/*
# Two reports ARE evidence and are kept: the honest before-picture, and the
# state at acceptance. Everything else is a mid-milestone snapshot that would
# otherwise accumulate one stale file per task.
!visual/report/baseline.json
!visual/report/populated.json
